> Anybody else know good places for lojban to network?


I think a great place for us to go would be Friendfeed.  I have a
Friendfeed here where I collect all my Lojbanic activities:

http://friendfeed.com/selckiku

Friendfeed allows you to easily organize together all your activity
from various sites, including youtube, reddit, flickr, blogs, etc.
They include 57 sites so far.  So if we followed each other on
friendfeed, we could each post to whatever sites we like, but also
remain aware of each other's activities.  I think that would make it
easier to generate critical mass for conversations in various places.


